-- not weighed against `the Severance Pay Law`: §§7(ד), 14, 20 and 24(ד)
-- counts the Oz 2023 shekel supplement, the school role allowance, the
-- principal's and deputy's supplements and the 2023 shekel supplement in
-- the wage severance is computed on, and §§5(ח) and 37(ו) leaves the grant
-- and the retirement grant out of it. Which components count, §13 sends to
-- the regulations, which compute that wage by the collective agreement that
-- applies (as the takanon's §1.28.2.3 brings them): a component counted
-- adds to the severance, and for one left out the agreement's word is what
-- the law looks to; §13ב's minimum-wage floor holds whatever is counted.

