-- §12's term "תלמיד משולב הזכאי לסל אישי": as §2 of the second schedule
-- to the Special Education Law, 1988, defines it (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_12/p2
`the integrated pupil of 23.9.2024 is defined by` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק חינוך מיוחד, התשמ\"ח-1988, התוספת השנייה, סעיף 2"

DECLARE `action of 23.9.2024` IS ONE OF
    `publish the school roles, their units and who holds them`
    `support a claim contrary to §§36–38`
    `transfer the sum to the union's fund`
    `make up five school days the strike lost`
    `negotiate further economic demands to 31.8.2028`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 23.9.2024 settles`
    `strike over flexible matriculation, academisation or the recess calendar`
    `decide disputes on the agreement of 23.9.2024 unanimously`

-- 14(יג): the principal publishes to the teachers the Ministry's guidelines
-- and criteria of (א) and (ג), the school roles set, the reward units of
-- each and who fills it.
@ref akn:art_14__para_ig
`publishing the school roles of 23.9.2024` MEANS
    PARTY `the principal`
    MUST  `publish the school roles, their units and who holds them`

DECLARE `what the school role reward of 23.9.2024 counts for` IS ONE OF
    `the hour value for substitution hours, school role reward of 23.9.2024`
    `the reduction for absence, school role reward of 23.9.2024`
    `paid absence, school role reward of 23.9.2024`
    `severance pay, school role reward of 23.9.2024`
    `pension contributions under section 46, school role reward of 23.9.2024`
    `topping up to the minimum wage, school role reward of 23.9.2024`

-- 14(טו): the school role reward counts for the hour value for substitution
-- hours, the reduction for absence, paid absence, severance and pension
-- contributions under §46 of the Oz agreement. Of the minimum wage it says
-- nothing: a monthly reward of fixed units for a role, which §3(ב)(3) of the
-- law counts as it stands (convention
-- instruments.minimum-wage-fixed-supplement).
@ref akn:art_14__para_jg
GIVEN p IS A `what the school role reward of 23.9.2024 counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school role reward of 23.9.2024 counts for` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `topping up to the minimum wage, school role reward of 23.9.2024`

-- Against the Minimum Wage Law's floor (MMS-601): §5(ט) leaves the one-time
-- grant out of the pay that counts toward the top-up, §7(ה) the Oz 2023
-- shekel supplement and §24(ה) the 2023 shekel supplement — the circular's
-- rows word for word, and their rules; leaving them out makes the top-up
-- the law's or more (its §11). Checked on a month's figures as if §3
-- counted each (a fixed supplement for the work), the strictest case.
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`how the one-time grant counts`'s `counts for the minimum-wage top-up` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`how the Oz 2023 shekel supplement counts`'s `counts for the minimum-wage top-up` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`how the 2023 shekel supplement counts`'s `counts for the minimum-wage top-up` EQUALS JUST TRUE)

§§ `39`

-- §39: the union declares it will not support claims contrary to the
-- section (the retirement grants of §§36–38, which the circular encodes).
@ref akn:art_39
`not supporting claims against the retirement grants of 23.9.2024` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `support a claim contrary to §§36–38`

§§ `40–42 קרנות`

-- §40: to the loans fund of §יב of the agreement of 12.9.1995, a further 5
-- million shekels: 3.5 million by December 2024 and 1.5 million by December
-- 2025. §41: to the sick-days fund of the agreement of 10.9.2003, 2
-- million, a million in each of 2026 and 2027 by December.
@ref akn:art_40/p1 akn:art_40/p2 akn:art_40/p3 akn:art_41/p1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the loans fund's sum of 23.9.2024 in` y IS
    BRANCH IF y EQUALS 2024 THEN 3500000
           IF y EQUALS 2025 THEN 1500000
           OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the sick-days fund's sum of 23.9.2024 in` y IS
    IF y EQUALS 2026 OR y EQUALS 2027 THEN 1000000 ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the loans fund's sum of 23.9.2024 in` 2024 PLUS `the loans fund's sum of 23.9.2024 in` 2025 EQUALS 5000000
#ASSERT `the sick-days fund's sum of 23.9.2024 in` 2026 PLUS `the sick-days fund's sum of 23.9.2024 in` 2027 EQUALS 2000000

-- not weighed against `the Sick Pay Law`: §41 only funds the sick-days
-- fund of the agreement of 10.9.2003 (weighed in that agreement's file),
-- and §37(ו), as in circular תשפ"ה/5, keeps the retirement grant out of the
-- compensation for unused sick days, a redemption the law does not give;
-- neither rules on sick pay or the days that accrue for it.

-- §42: (א) from 2024 the welfare fund of the Oz agreement's §51, 13.5
-- million a year on the eve, rises by 15 million to 28.5 million (the
-- "increased yearly sum"); (ב) it serves also for holiday gifts, and the
-- rise exhausts the union's claims on them; (ג) a one-time 10 million more:
-- 1 million in 2025, 4.5 in 2026, 4.5 in 2027; (ד) and 4 million for
-- pensioners' activity: 2 in 2024, 2 in 2025; (ה) §51's other rules stand.
@ref akn:art_42__para_a akn:art_42__para_b akn:art_42__para_c akn:art_42__para_c/p2 akn:art_42__para_c/p3 akn:art_42__para_c/p4 akn:art_42__para_d akn:art_42__para_d/p2 akn:art_42__para_d/p3 akn:art_42__para_e
`the welfare fund's yearly sum from 2024, by 23.9.2024` MEANS 28500000

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the welfare fund's one-time sums of 23.9.2024 in` y IS
    BRANCH IF y EQUALS 2024 THEN 2000000
           IF y EQUALS 2025 THEN 1000000 PLUS 2000000
           IF y EQUALS 2026 THEN 4500000
           IF y EQUALS 2027 THEN 4500000
           OTHERWISE 0

#ASSERT 13500000 PLUS 15000000 EQUALS `the welfare fund's yearly sum from 2024, by 23.9.2024`
#ASSERT sum (map `the welfare fund's one-time sums of 23.9.2024 in` (LIST 2024, 2025, 2026, 2027)) EQUALS 14000000

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `action of 23.9.2024`
DECIDE `paying the union's funds of 23.9.2024 in` y IS
    IF `the loans fund's sum of 23.9.2024 in` y PLUS `the sick-days fund's sum of 23.9.2024 in` y PLUS `the welfare fund's one-time sums of 23.9.2024 in` y GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `transfer the sum to the union's fund`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `44–45`

-- akn:art_44 §44's heading, "תשלום הפרשים"; its paragraph is as in circular תשפ"ה/5 (above).

-- §45: following the director-general's notice of 23.9.2024 on making up
-- the high schools' school days lost to strike days, the teachers make up
-- five school days as it sets out; the other two strike days are an absence
-- without pay, under the notice's terms (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_45/p1
`the strike days made up under §45 of 23.9.2024` MEANS 5
`the strike days unpaid under §45 of 23.9.2024` MEANS 2

`making up the strike days of 23.9.2024` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `make up five school days the strike lost`

§§ `46 ביטול סכסוכי עבודה`

-- §46: every labour dispute the union declared up to the signing is void,
-- save local disputes over demands that add no cost to the practice before
-- them and bear on no other employer.
@ref akn:art_46/p1
GIVEN `a local dispute adding no cost and bearing on no other employer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a dispute stands after 23.9.2024` `a local dispute adding no cost and bearing on no other employer` IF
    `a local dispute adding no cost and bearing on no other employer`

§§ `47 מיצוי תביעות`

-- (א): the agreement exhausts what it settles; (ב): and every claim for
-- economic demands raising the cost of employment, or further benefits, for
-- the period to 31.8.2028 — no further negotiation on it; (ג): and the
-- union's claims on the effects of flexible matriculation (§29),
-- academisation (§30) and the change of the recess calendar in the
-- director-general's letter of 23.9.2024; (ד): §12 takes nothing from
-- this, save the number of integrated pupils that entitles to the reward
-- or grant and its rate, within the budget, which are negotiated; (ה): it
-- takes nothing from the exhaustion clauses already between the parties.
-- not weighed against `the Annual Leave Law`: §47(ג) and §48(ב) name the
-- change of the recess calendar only as a matter the union's claims are
-- exhausted on and no strike is taken over; the change itself is the
-- director-general's letter of 23.9.2024, outside the corpus, so nothing
-- here sets a day of leave the law could be weighed against.
@ref akn:art_47__para_a akn:art_47__para_b akn:art_47__para_c akn:art_47__para_d akn:art_47__para_e
`the period the agreement of 23.9.2024 exhausts ends on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2028

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `action of 23.9.2024`
DECIDE `no further economic demands of 23.9.2024 on` d IS
    IF d `is on or before` `the period the agreement of 23.9.2024 exhausts ends on`
    THEN PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
         SHANT `negotiate further economic demands to 31.8.2028`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `48 שקט תעשייתי`

-- (א): to 31.8.2029, inclusive, no strike, lockout or organised disruption
-- over what the agreement settles; (ב): nor by the union over the effects
-- of flexible matriculation, academisation or the recess calendar; (ג):
-- §12 takes nothing from this; (ד): nor this from the industrial peace
-- already between the parties.
@ref akn:art_48__para_a akn:art_48__para_b akn:art_48__para_c akn:art_48__para_d
`the industrial peace of 23.9.2024 ends on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2029

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `action of 23.9.2024`
DECIDE `industrial peace of 23.9.2024 on` d IS
    IF d `is on or before` `the industrial peace of 23.9.2024 ends on`
    THEN PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
         SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 23.9.2024 settles`
    ELSE FULFILLED

`no strike over the effects of 23.9.2024's programmes` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `strike over flexible matriculation, academisation or the recess calendar`

§§ `49 כללי`

-- (א): nothing here, the scope clause and its being made for the high
-- schools alone among it, is consent to a separate bargaining unit in
-- post-primary education (grades 7–14), nor a waiver of any claim on the
-- union's representation there. (ב): earlier terms, the Oz agreement's
-- among them, stand unless amended or cancelled, expressly or by
-- implication.
@ref akn:art_49__para_a akn:art_49__para_b
`the agreement of 23.9.2024 consents to a separate bargaining unit` MEANS FALSE
`earlier terms stand after 23.9.2024 unless amended` MEANS TRUE

§§ `50 יישוב חילוקי דעות`

-- (א): a follow-up committee of the parties' representatives helps to
-- interpret and carry out the agreement, follows it, and decides disputes
-- on it unanimously; (ב): representatives of the Ministries of Education
-- and Finance take part, and every decision needs their consent; (ג): this
-- takes nothing from any power under §29 of the Budget Foundations Law.
@ref akn:art_50__para_a akn:art_50__para_b akn:art_50__para_c
`following the agreement of 23.9.2024` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `decide disputes on the agreement of 23.9.2024 unanimously`

GIVEN `the parties' representatives agree` IS A BOOLEAN, `the ministries' representatives consent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a decision of the follow-up committee of 23.9.2024 stands` `the parties' representatives agree` `the ministries' representatives consent` IF
    `the parties' representatives agree` AND `the ministries' representatives consent`

-- akn:conclusions/p1 akn:conclusions/p2 akn:conclusions/t1 akn:conclusions/p3 akn:conclusions/p4 The signing formula and the signatures of the employers and ארגון המורים; no rule.

